	<title>燕珍拜票目睹身障行人跌倒送醫　主張推動「人行道路平專案」 - 互傳媒</title><link rel="preload" as="image" imagesrcset="https://hoomedia.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18bf9f8a8207086c1c32f7aeedaaedbd-768x768.jpg 768w, https://hoomedia.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18bf9f8a8207086c1c32f7aeedaaedbd-150x150.jpg 150w, https://hoomedia.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18bf9f8a8207086c1c32f7aeedaaedbd-450x450.jpg 450w, https://hoomedia.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18bf9f8a8207086c1c32f7aeedaaedbd.jpg 1200w" imagesizes="(max-width: 755px) 100vw, 755px" /><link rel="preload" as="font" href="https://hoomedia.com.tw/wp-content/themes/smart-mag/css/icons/fonts/ts-icons.woff2?v2.8" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" />
